<title>PORTUGAL: Ylds ease at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</title>
<headline>Ylds ease at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it drained 168 billion escudos of four-week funds at 5.7720 percent, against 5.7934 percent previously.</p>
<p>It drained 43 billion escudos of nine-week funds at 5.6963 percent against 5.7473 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
